{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1782.unity3d","item_key":"commands[17].text","source_sha256":"e837bf3e0aa19351afcdd3f7a59f549577b9174ca9eebf5c000fb4c09a6744f8","ja":"はいなのです。……ほ？　そういえば、\n歌織ちゃんと可憐ちゃんはどこにいるのです？","zh":"是的哦。……嗯？说起来，歌织和可怜在哪里呢？","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T16:50:40+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1782.unity3d","item_key":"commands[18].text","source_sha256":"25984d8a212978e055e4fb382bb69ebde89547be9825e7a4360ce1dd5604964e","ja":"社員の方とお話しされているようでしたが……\nあら？　あの人だかりは～……！？","zh":"您好像正在和工作人员交谈……  \n咦？那边聚集的人群是～……！？","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T16:50:40+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1782.unity3d","item_key":"commands[26].text","source_sha256":"ad20fc5f1f628f8c19bc707b685e312e68db6b3fd79e9083660916434753f4ab","ja":"「お世話になっております。私、広報担当の……」\n「みなさんとのコラボ、とても評判がよく……」","zh":"“您好，我是负责宣传工作的……”\n“和大家的合作反响非常好……”","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T16:50:40+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1782.unity3d","item_key":"commands[27].text","source_sha256":"5d50189c0b82fdd74e191a43e53cb6e655df5c6044b515a3ec56f9c75fb44b7b","ja":"あっ、はい。ありがとうございます。\nこちらの方は……はい。あ、そうなんですね……。","zh":"啊，好的。谢谢您。至于这位……嗯。啊，原来是这样啊……","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T16:50:40+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1782.unity3d","item_key":"commands[28].text","source_sha256":"0cb73d59c4f922abf95d8e8be66d95485dc316ae93df643e4863d5b922d7f808","ja":"「お衣装、とってもお似合いですね……」\n「可憐さんにぜひ、ご紹介させていただきたい人が……」","zh":"“这身服装非常适合您呢……”\n“有一位我特别想介绍给可怜小姐认识的人……”","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T16:50:40+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1782.unity3d","item_key":"commands[29].text","source_sha256":"c8c34c340da73a729e691bb57b7abe00b474e39ea7ace5afdaf3a27bc4a77480","ja":"は、はい……。こ、こちらこそ……\nその……えっと～……うう～……。","zh":"好、好的……彼、彼此彼此……\n那个……呃～……呜呜～……","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T16:50:40+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1782.unity3d","item_key":"commands[38].text","source_sha256":"803e103a3e7215a990d56ac20debe8a08eb07dcb3f2277f307ec74e29072ad66","ja":"ま、まつりさんが呼びに来てくれて……\r\nなんとか、戻ってこれました～……。","zh":"多、多亏了茉莉来叫我……总算是回来了～……","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T16:50:40+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1782.unity3d","item_key":"commands[39].text","source_sha256":"affd16b06a01c2091f81a75aee8855d6ed97e0b66449bf961e286c7a1edef476","ja":"可憐と歌織さんの前に行列ができてたけど、何が……\nわあっ！？　すごい数の名刺！？","zh":"可怜和歌织小姐面前排起了长队，到底是怎么回事……\n哇！？　好多名片！？","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T16:50:40+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1782.unity3d","item_key":"commands[40].text","source_sha256":"2dc7d2039eba2b5cf73ea38a243fb673d4a01619a1673c638fc69eab0bf8299b","ja":"これ、全部、可憐ちゃんと歌織ちゃんがもらったの\nです？　ふたりとも、大人気なのです！","zh":"这些全都是可怜和歌织收到的吗？两个人都超受欢迎的！","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T16:50:40+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1782.unity3d","item_key":"commands[41].text","source_sha256":"c73ec63992ee1d95fade127386c55acd01ebfc99cc357746e0efd58c713e1429","ja":"そ、その……社員さんが……\n何人も、あ、挨拶してくれて……。","zh":"那、那个……好几位公司员工都、都来跟我打招呼……","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T16:50:40+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1782.unity3d","item_key":"commands[51].text","source_sha256":"4d30596e4ee4b84c5694c90c4697f272e70a61f10727d9a8a4bd7e14046a2761","ja":"ミラス・ミランや、スカジ以外の会社のも\r\nいっぱいあるよ！？","zh":"米拉斯·米兰和斯卡吉以外的公司也有很多呢！？","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T16:50:40+00:00"}
