{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1782.unity3d","item_key":"commands[54].text","source_sha256":"965941629fc5106d7ff12628029b447423e8442793d09cd93fd6bdaa17e80e24","ja":"や、やっぱり私には、まつりちゃんや\n朋花ちゃんみたいな対応は、まだ無理みたい……。","zh":"果、果然对我来说，像茉莉和朋花那样应对，还是做不到……","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T16:50:40+00:00"}
